{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/ShortestSimplePaths","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ShortestSimplePaths","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/ShortestPaths\/ShortestSimplePaths.swift#L326","fileName":"ShortestSimplePaths.swift"},"symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ShortestSimplePaths","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:13ShortestPaths0a6SimpleB0V","title":"ShortestSimplePaths","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"ShortestPaths"}]},"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/ST"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ShortestSimplePaths","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Distance","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","text":"DirectedGraph","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Distance","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AdditiveArithmetic","preciseIdentif